  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, the&nbsp;roots of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> and <math><mi>&#946;</mi></math></p><p>We know that the sum and product of roots of a quadratic equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are respectively&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is maximum,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;the equation is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
